# atomic sandbox scene v1
# The replay scripts' H2 (Bohr): the h2 preset as it was until 2026-10-14 - R = 1.6 Bohr on its own
# 49^3 x 0.25 grid - the geometry the scripts' world points and expectations were written for (the
# preset itself is now R = 1.45 Bohr; `scene::h2_r16` is the same scene for the Rust tests).
grid 49 0.25
charge 0
nucleus 1  0.8 0 0
nucleus 1 -0.8 0 0
